Scenario. Ego vehicle at 25\,\text{m/s}, leading vehicle at 20\,\text{m/s}, distance 30\,\text{m}. Safe distance d_{\text{safe}} = 50\,\text{m}. The safe set is defined by h(x) = d - d_{\text{safe}} \ge 0. With sensor noise, we use a robust CBF margin \gamma = 0.5\,\text{m/s}^2.

The AI proposes a lane change with acceleration 2\,\text{m/s}^2.

