2. Conformal harm. Ensemble mean 0.03, conformal quantile q = 0.02 → H = 0.05.
3. Risk. Physical risk 0.02, societal 0.01 → R = 0.015.
4. Uncertainty. Conformal width 0.04, normalised U = 0.2. Threshold \tau_U = 0.3, so U \le \tau_U.
