If rain degrades sensor accuracy, the conformal width increases to U = 0.6 > \tau_U. If a teleoperator is available (O=1), control is deferred; otherwise, the vehicle executes a minimal‑risk braking manoeuvre that preserves h(x)\ge 0 via the RCBF fallback.

